"i1-ipl": {
"svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 440 170\" class=\"fig\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The IPL question (Lec1 slides 7–8, 55). Batsman 2 has the higher average, but Batsman 1's scores sit much closer together: lower standard deviation means more consistent.\"><defs><marker id=\"ah-i1ipl\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"ah\"/></marker><clipPath id=\"cp-i1ipl\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"440\" height=\"170\"/></clipPath></defs><line x1=\"84\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"414\" y2=\"140\" class=\"ax\"/><line x1=\"84\" y1=\"137\" x2=\"84\" y2=\"143\" class=\"ax\"/><text x=\"84\" y=\"156\" class=\"ts\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><line x1=\"131.1\" y1=\"137\" x2=\"131.1\" y2=\"143\" class=\"ax\"/><text x=\"131.1\" y=\"156\" class=\"ts\" text-anchor=\"middle\">20</text><line x1=\"178.3\" y1=\"137\" x2=\"178.3\" y2=\"143\" class=\"ax\"/><text x=\"178.3\" y=\"156\" class=\"ts\" text-anchor=\"middle\">40</text><line x1=\"225.4\" y1=\"137\" x2=\"225.4\" y2=\"143\" class=\"ax\"/><text x=\"225.4\" y=\"156\" class=\"ts\" text-anchor=\"middle\">60</text><line x1=\"272.6\" y1=\"137\" x2=\"272.6\" y2=\"143\" class=\"ax\"/><text x=\"272.6\" y=\"156\" class=\"ts\" text-anchor=\"middle\">80</text><line x1=\"319.7\" y1=\"137\" x2=\"319.7\" y2=\"143\" class=\"ax\"/><text x=\"319.7\" y=\"156\" class=\"ts\" text-anchor=\"middle\">100</text><line x1=\"366.9\" y1=\"137\" x2=\"366.9\" y2=\"143\" class=\"ax\"/><text x=\"366.9\" y=\"156\" class=\"ts\" text-anchor=\"middle\">120</text><line x1=\"414\" y1=\"137\" x2=\"414\" y2=\"143\" class=\"ax\"/><text x=\"414\" y=\"156\" class=\"ts\" text-anchor=\"middle\">140</text><circle cx=\"190.1\" cy=\"52\" r=\"5\" class=\"d1\"><title>45</title></circle><circle cx=\"230.1\" cy=\"52\" r=\"5\" class=\"d1\"><title>62</title></circle><circle cx=\"286.7\" cy=\"52\" r=\"5\" class=\"d1\"><title>86</title></circle><circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"52\" r=\"5\" class=\"d1\"><title>28</title></circle><circle cx=\"187.7\" cy=\"52\" r=\"5\" class=\"d1\"><title>44</title></circle><text x=\"76\" y=\"56\" class=\"tb\" text-anchor=\"end\">Batsman 1</text><circle cx=\"164.1\" cy=\"112\" r=\"5\" class=\"d2\"><title>34</title></circle><circle cx=\"267.9\" cy=\"112\" r=\"5\" class=\"d2\"><title>78</title></circle><circle cx=\"112.3\" cy=\"112\" r=\"5\" class=\"d2\"><title>12</title></circle><circle cx=\"402.2\" cy=\"112\" r=\"5\" class=\"d2\"><title>135</title></circle><circle cx=\"234.9\" cy=\"112\" r=\"5\" class=\"d2\"><title>64</title></circle><text x=\"76\" y=\"116\" class=\"tb\" text-anchor=\"end\">Batsman 2</text><line x1=\"208.9\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"208.9\" y2=\"66\" class=\"guide\"/><text x=\"208.9\" y=\"26\" class=\"ts\" text-anchor=\"middle\">mean 53</text><line x1=\"236.3\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"236.3\" y2=\"126\" class=\"guide\"/><text x=\"236.3\" y=\"86\" class=\"ts\" text-anchor=\"middle\">mean 64.6</text><text x=\"402.2\" y=\"100\" class=\"ts2\" text-anchor=\"middle\">135</text><text x=\"76\" y=\"68\" class=\"ts2\" text-anchor=\"end\">σ ≈ 19.7</text><text x=\"76\" y=\"128\" class=\"ts2\" text-anchor=\"end\">σ ≈ 42.05</text></svg>",
"caption": "The IPL question (Lec1 slides 7–8, 55). Batsman 2 has the higher average, but Batsman 1's scores sit much closer together: lower standard deviation means **more consistent**."
},
